Prices in this review were typed from 2 source screen(s) and are recorded above with their observation timestamps. Unlike a block height, a price cannot be re-read later: the market has moved and the venues do not expose the historical book. What is reproducible is the arithmetic over the recorded prices and the settlement rules quoted verbatim, both of which are in this evidence set. Anyone disputing the figures can recompute them; nobody can re-observe them, and this review does not claim otherwise.